# Wokelo Docs

- [Home](https://docs.wokelo.ai/home.md): Build with Wokelo
- [Introduction](https://docs.wokelo.ai/introduction.md): Wokelo's API suite is purpose-built for developers building dealmaking AI infrastructure. It delivers structured, processed intelligence at the quality standard investment and advisory workflows demand. The underlying data is purpose-built for AI pipelines:
- [Choosing the right API](https://docs.wokelo.ai/choosing-the-right-api.md)
- [Getting started](https://docs.wokelo.ai/getting-started.md)
- [Credits](https://docs.wokelo.ai/credits.md)
- [How Async APIs work](https://docs.wokelo.ai/how-async-apis-work.md)
- [Company Instant Enrichment](https://docs.wokelo.ai/company-instant-enrichment-doc.md): Retrieve structured firmographic, funding, financial, M&A, headcount, and web traffic data for any company from Wokelo's native database of 20M+ cached companies — synchronously for a single company, or asynchronously in batch for multiple companies at once.
- [Alternative Datasets](https://docs.wokelo.ai/alternative-datasets.md): Access proprietary alternative datasets on any company — G2 product reviews with star distributions and individual review text, and Glassdoor employee reviews with aggregate sentiment ratings and individual review records — returned synchronously with flexible pagination.
- [Company Filings and Transcripts](https://docs.wokelo.ai/company-filings-and-transcripts.md): Access SEC filings (10-K, 10-Q, 8-K, and more) and earnings call transcripts for public companies — returned synchronously with full document content and flexible filtering by form type and date range.
- [Company Instant Enrichment (Batch)](https://docs.wokelo.ai/company-instant-enrichment-doc-batch.md)
- [Company Deep Intelligence](https://docs.wokelo.ai/company-deep-intelligence-doc.md): Generate on-demand AI-synthesised intelligence on one or more companies simultaneously — selectively requesting product portfolios, launch timelines, strategic initiatives, partnerships, business models, key customers, leadership profiles, and employee or product sentiment in a single composable req…
- [Industry Deep Intelligence](https://docs.wokelo.ai/industry-deep-intelligence-doc.md): Generate on-demand structured intelligence on any industry — selectively requesting market sizing, quantitative insights, M&A and fundraising activity, innovation trends, tier-1 research, partnerships, regulations, and case studies in a single composable request.
- [Get Company Jobs](https://docs.wokelo.ai/jobs.md): Fetch the latest open job postings for any company — including job title, location, work-type, salary metadata, and the job_id needed to retrieve full job details — returned synchronously with simple page-based pagination.
- [Company Job Details](https://docs.wokelo.ai/job-details.md): Fetch the full details of a single job posting by its job ID — title, location, full description, employment type, salary, industries, job functions, and experience level — returned synchronously.
- [Market Map](https://docs.wokelo.ai/market-map-doc.md): Discover and map all companies competing in a specific market or product category using AI — returns a ranked, enriched list of companies with firmographic, financial, and AI-scored fit data.
- [Target Screening](https://docs.wokelo.ai/target-screening-doc.md): Identify and score potential acquisition targets for a defined acquirer using AI — returns a ranked list of strategic and bolt-on targets with deal feasibility scores, synergy analysis, and full firmographic and financial data.
- [Buyer Screening](https://docs.wokelo.ai/buyer-screening-doc.md): Identify and score potential acquirers for a target company using AI — returns a ranked list of strategic and financial buyers with deal feasibility scores, synergy analysis, and full firmographic and financial data.
- [Competitor List](https://docs.wokelo.ai/competitor-list-doc.md): Generate a long list of companies similar to a given company using AI — returns a ranked, enriched peer set with firmographic, financial, and AI-scored similarity data.
- [M&A Activity](https://docs.wokelo.ai/acquisitions-doc.md): Retrieve structured mergers and acquisitions data for a defined market or report — returns a complete transaction record set with deal amounts, acquirer and target profiles, deal status, and news context.
- [Fundraise Activity](https://docs.wokelo.ai/fundraise-doc.md): Retrieve structured fundraising and investment activity data for a defined market or report — returns a complete funding round record set with amounts, stages, investor profiles, company firmographics, and news context.
- [Company News Monitoring](https://docs.wokelo.ai/company-news-monitoring-doc.md): Fetch the latest news articles for any company, enriched with AI-generated summaries, event categories, sentiment signals, publisher metadata, and full article text — returned synchronously with flexible date, category, and publisher filtering.
- [Industry News Monitoring](https://docs.wokelo.ai/industry-news-monitoring-doc.md): Fetch the latest news articles for any industry topic or sector, enriched with AI-generated summaries and geographic tags — returned synchronously with flexible date, geography, and publisher filtering.
- [Newsfeed](https://docs.wokelo.ai/newsfeed-doc.md): Fetch a curated, signal-filtered news feed across any combination of industries, event categories, sentiment, geography, and breaking news — returned synchronously with all filters applied simultaneously in a single POST request.
- [Company Research](https://docs.wokelo.ai/company-research-doc.md): Generate a comprehensive, source-cited company intelligence report — covering firmographics, executive summary, key insights, product portfolio, and M&A activity — as a structured JSON, PDF, DOCX, or PPT deliverable.
- [Industry Research](https://docs.wokelo.ai/industry-research-doc.md): Generate a comprehensive, source-cited sector intelligence report — covering market overview, executive summary, key insights, trends and innovations, and select transaction activity — as a structured JSON, PDF, DOCX, or PPT deliverable.
- [Peer Comparison](https://docs.wokelo.ai/peer-comparison-doc.md): Generate a comprehensive side-by-side benchmarking report for 2–5 companies — covering firmographics, financials, product offerings, feature matrices, business models, employee sentiment, hiring trends, and online visibility — as structured JSON, PDF, DOCX, or PPT.
- [Earnings Analysis](https://docs.wokelo.ai/earnings-analysis.md)
- [Custom Workflow](https://docs.wokelo.ai/custom-workflow-automation-doc.md): Trigger any of Wokelo's pre-built specialist workflows — IC memos, CIM reviews, deal factsheets, M&A opportunity identification, value chain analysis, market sizing, and more — via API, using the same async submit-poll-download pattern as all Workflow APIs.
